  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the differential equation representing the family of all circles touching <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at the origin is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>y</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> equals</p>",
    "image": null
  },
